<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Menú - Pantalla 2</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #0b0b0b;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 40px;
        }
        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #ff6b00;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            color: #ff6b00;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .menu-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 30px;
            max-width: 1600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .menu-card {
            background: #161616;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border-left: 6px solid #ff6b00;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-in-out;
        }
        .item-details h3 {
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .item-details p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #a0a0a0;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        .item-price {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #4CAF50;
            white-space: nowrap;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Burritos y Especialidades de la Casa</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="menu-grid">
        <div class="menu-card">
            <div class="item-details">
                <h3>Burrito Arlene's Special</h3>
                <p>Carne asada, frijoles de la olla, queso fundido y salsa pico de gallo</p>
            </div>
            <div class="item-price">$12.50</div>
        </div>
        <div class="menu-card">
            <div class="item-details">
                <h3>Tacos de Birria (Orden de 3)</h3>
                <p>Acompañados de consomé caliente, cilantro, cebolla y salsa roja</p>
            </div>
            <div class="item-price">$13.99</div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
